-- the regulative rule: a director SHANT make the application
-- EXPECT: BREACH
#TRACE `s 1004(1) the director's duty not to make the application` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `s 1004 make an application under section 1003 on behalf of the company` AT 5
-- EXPECT: RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 1004(1) the director's duty not to make the application` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 50)
-- not prohibited: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 1004(1) the director's duty not to make the application` (JUST FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `s 1004 make an application under section 1003 on behalf of the company` AT 5
